"""
foamSHM - Browse, search, generate and check OpenFOAM snappyHexMeshDict settings.

The database is a keyword dictionary of snappyHexMeshDict built from
  - the annotated dictionary  etc/caseDicts/annotated/snappyHexMeshDict
    (including the commented-out optional entries) and etc/caseDicts/meshQualityDict,
  - the C++ sources that read the dictionary (get / getOrDefault /
    readIfPresent / found ...), which give mandatory/optional and defaults,
  - the Enum name tables (allowed values),
  - the searchableSurface types (geometry 'type') and their header docs,
  - every snappyHexMeshDict found in the tutorials (real usage).

Keyword paths use placeholders for user-defined names, e.g.
    castellatedMeshControls/refinementSurfaces/<surface>/level

Sub-commands:
    build     Scan the sources and write the database
    tree      Show the dictionary structure (mandatory/optional, defaults)
    search    Full-text search in keywords and descriptions
    show      Show description, default, choices, sources and usage of a keyword
              or of a geometry type (box, cylinder, triSurfaceMesh, ...)
    example   Print real usage taken from the tutorials
    template  Generate a ready-to-edit snappyHexMeshDict
    check     Check an existing snappyHexMeshDict (typos, missing entries,
              geometry names, surface files, locationInMesh)
    html      Generate the stand-alone catalog.html

Database lookup order:
    1. $FOAMSHM_DB
    2. ${XDG_DATA_HOME:-~/.local/share}/foamSHM/shmDatabase-<version>.json,
       where <version> is the basename of $WM_PROJECT_DIR (written by 'build')
    3. shmDatabase.json bundled next to this script
"""

